## Third-party code

`presentation/silent_text.go` contains text-layout code derived from
`gioui.org/widget.Label` (SPDX-License-Identifier: Unlicense OR MIT), copied so
a row fragment can paint without contributing its own semantic node. The file
carries the upstream SPDX identifier. Re-check it against upstream whenever the
pinned `gioui.org` version changes: it duplicates upstream internals and will
not track upstream fixes on its own.
